msgstr "Active Defense: 상태, 시뮬레이션, 정리(threats, incidents, deception도 참고)."

#: src/omega_serv/interfaces/cli/main.py:1913
msgid ""
"Affiche l'état : mode, mode guerre, leurres, nombre de sources suivies."
